<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xml:lang="en-US"><voice name="en-US-EmmaMultilingualNeural">Number two.<break time="1150ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-AriaNeural">I signed up for the beginner yoga class that meets on Wednesday evenings.<break time="550ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural">That class has moved to Thursday because the instructor is attending a training course.<break time="180ms"/> The starting time is still seven.<break time="550ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-AriaNeural">Thursday works for me.<break time="180ms"/> Do I need to register again at the front desk?<break time="550ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural">No, your name is already on the new list.<break time="180ms"/> Just bring the same membership card.<break time="1100ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-EmmaMultilingualNeural">Question.<break time="350ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-EmmaMultilingualNeural">What is true about the yoga class?</voice></speak>
